    sortBubbleHint: "Like students lining up by height, it compares two neighboring bars and swaps them if they are in the wrong order. After many passes, the biggest bars bubble to the end.",
    sortInsertionHint: "Like sorting cards in your hand, it takes one bar at a time and slides it into the correct place among the bars that are already sorted.",
    sortSelectionHint: "Like picking the shortest person for the front of the line, it finds the smallest remaining bar, moves it to the front, and repeats.",
