        qA1aText: "It learns patterns from many examples.",
        qA1aExp: "Correct — learning patterns from data is the key sign of AI.",
        qA1bText: "It runs on a fast computer.",
        qA1bExp: "Speed doesn't make something AI.",
        qA1cText: "It has a chat window.",
        qA1cExp: "A chat window is just an interface, not what makes it AI.",
        qA1dText: "A person wrote every rule it follows.",
        qA1dExp: "That describes a traditional rule-based program, not AI.",
