        qA3bExp: "Correct — high confidence doesn't guarantee a correct answer.",
        qA3cText: "95% of families agree with it.",
        qA3cExp: "It's not a vote of people.",
        qA3dText: "It checked 95 sources.",
        qA3dExp: "Confidence isn't a count of sources.",
